        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Derpy honey-harvesting arcade. Cut, harvest honey, earn honey-money, and buy weapons to slice even more.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The loop is simple but merciless:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice combs while dodging enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell honey and stack up your honey-money.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new weapons and silly cosmetics (yes, you can get ears and a tail).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep trying until your keyboard cries for mercy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 levels with unique obstacles and enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bees. Ultra-bees. Electro-bees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death worms and pink tentacles of pain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Falling TVs, irons, and other household junk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touch of physics chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why play?</strong><br>To test your nerves, reflexes, and — most importantly — your respect for bees.<br>Because sweet honey is worth it.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/483abe80c22b3cf6e4ceb3e72e338045.poster.avif?t=1786400405\" width=615 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/483abe80c22b3cf6e4ceb3e72e338045.webm?t=1786400405\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3927140/extras/b1f7c7